#  dragon, sierengowski brand, and cinematic non-alien packs.
#  One slug per line; anything after '#' is a comment.
#  © 2026 JOSEPH A. SIERENGOWSKI · NYX-J5W-2026-SIERENGOWSKI-LOCKED
# ============================================================

